tyle=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 16.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -16.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">9.26.(금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">), 09.30(화), 10.2.(목), 10.10.(금)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">10:30~16:30</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학생회관 옆&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">B&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">구역 주차장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대한적십자사&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈버스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><b>협조사항</b></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신분증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">주민등록증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">운전면허증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학생증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">모바일신분증 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">지참</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나. \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">레드커넥트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">\"&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">스마트폰 헌혈앱 설치 권고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전자문진 및 검사결과 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>기타사항</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈시 봉사시간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">시간 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">사회복지자원봉사인증관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(VMS)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">연계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 건강체크</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액검사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간염</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간기능&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">ALT,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">총단백 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 대상 헌혈증서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">기념품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">급식품 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 라.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">오전 헌혈 접수마감 시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 11:30 (11:30~12:00&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈진행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 마. 오후 헌혈 접수시작 시간: 13:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-si